OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mix of bright spells and a
OL,6,Ffew showers is expected during the
OL,7,Fmorning. It will turn drier for a time
OL,8,Finto the afternoon, though remaining
OL,9,Fcloudy. Light rain likely to return to
OL,10,Fthe region by mid-afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FFurther outbreaks of rain are
OL,13,Flikely into the evening and overnight,
OL,14,Fperhaps with some heavier bursts over
OL,15,Fthe hills of Cumbria. Winds becoming
OL,16,Fgusty later in the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
