OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FOvercast for much of the day
OL,6,Fon Tuesday with outbreaks of rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle, the heaviest of which will be
OL,8,Facross the north of the region.
OL,9,FTemperatures near average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FThe
OL,12,Funsettled theme conditions into the
OL,13,Frest of the week. There will be some
OL,14,Fwarm sunshine at times. However,
OL,15,Fshowers are also likely, especially in
OL,16,Fthe north. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
